  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced capacity for better governance of labour migration and protection of migrant workers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the 2024-2025 biennium, ILO will support the development and adoption of operational frameworks and tools which could lead to results under 6.4.1 and 6.4.2. These will take the form of finalization, expansion and operationalization of SOPs for the Ministry of Labour&#x2019;s Units concerned with external employment, tools for labour inspectors, strengthening access of Egyptian migrant workers to social protection. ILO will continue to support CAPMAS to ensure full alignment of Egyptian data with ICLS standards and recommendations.</narrative>
  </description>
